WEBVTT

00:00:22.210 --> 00:00:26.970
Seeking out a single ray of light,
hito-suji no hikari wo motome

00:00:27.440 --> 00:00:34.210
All I can do is wander on, no matter how far.
hitasura doko made mo tada samayou

00:00:35.790 --> 00:00:42.950
As I breathe a sigh not unlike surrender,
akirame ni nita tameiki wo tsuki-nagara

00:00:43.010 --> 00:00:52.270
I don't want to fear how I've been hurt, all the time.
kizutsuku koto wo osoretaku nai yo itsu mo

00:00:52.410 --> 00:00:54.650
Set me free now!

00:00:54.670 --> 00:01:01.060
Come on, let it all go, to the far reaches of time,
saa tokihanate subete toki no kanata ni

00:01:01.060 --> 00:01:01.080
From that which binds the soul!
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo

00:01:01.080 --> 00:01:06.910
tamashii wo shibaru mono wo
From that which binds the soul!

00:01:06.950 --> 00:01:09.200
For my heartbeat!

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.690
Make freedom your weapon,
jiyuu wo buki ni

00:01:11.690 --> 00:01:11.760
And you are sure to attain it!
kitto te ni ireru no yo

00:01:11.760 --> 00:01:15.470
kitto te ni ireru no yo
And you are sure to attain it!

00:01:15.470 --> 00:01:15.510
The power to believe and dream is there
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo

00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:21.590
shinjiru chikara wo yume wo
The power to believe and dream is there

00:01:21.590 --> 00:01:21.630
for you to go on living.
ikite yuku tame ni

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:25.960
ikite yuku tame ni
for you to go on living.

00:01:50.450 --> 00:01:51.470
Yuji...

00:02:13.470 --> 00:02:14.730
Don't!

00:02:14.800 --> 00:02:17.070
Yuji!!

00:02:17.140 --> 00:02:22.080
You must not fight any more! Open your eyes!

00:02:22.140 --> 00:02:27.100
Yuji... do you know me? It's me! It's Marlene.

00:02:29.820 --> 00:02:31.310
Marlene...?

00:03:07.460 --> 00:03:09.820
Yu... ji...

00:03:33.750 --> 00:03:35.550
Yuji...

00:03:46.090 --> 00:03:48.030
Why...?

00:03:48.100 --> 00:03:54.660
Why can't I? You're the one who woke me up, aren't you Marlene?

00:03:55.770 --> 00:04:03.040
You're the one who taught me to fight in order to live. And yet, why now...?

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:06.050
Listen to me, Yuji!!

00:04:06.110 --> 00:04:07.450
The situation has changed.

00:04:07.520 --> 00:04:09.140
If you pilot the Double Edge any longer,

00:04:09.220 --> 00:04:12.050
your B cells will be activated indefinitely!

00:04:12.120 --> 00:04:15.390
If that happens you'll be...!

00:04:15.460 --> 00:04:21.050
That too will be in the interest of defeating the Blue, right?

00:04:21.130 --> 00:04:24.460
Do not... interfere...

00:05:35.070 --> 00:05:37.000
The Blue's numbers are increasing further.

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:39.670
- Range, roughly 1 kilo.
- Still no reinforcements?

00:05:39.740 --> 00:05:44.010
Second Earth is as silent as before. There is no response.

00:05:44.080 --> 00:05:46.550
What the hell are they doing up there!?

00:05:54.760 --> 00:05:57.690
Requests from the surface for support units continue.

00:05:57.760 --> 00:06:00.020
It appears they are meeting with a large-scale counterattack from the Blue.

00:06:00.100 --> 00:06:01.690
How much longer will it take?

00:06:01.760 --> 00:06:05.030
The control system has been successfully broken into...

00:06:05.100 --> 00:06:06.690
...on the resource mining station in orbit around the moon.

00:06:06.770 --> 00:06:08.360
They can have it under our control in about one hour.

00:06:08.440 --> 00:06:10.030
How about you?

00:06:10.110 --> 00:06:12.700
We've already secured all the station's systems.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.370
What about Victor?

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:17.710
Still holed up in the medical station, with no response.

00:06:23.790 --> 00:06:26.380
Contact from the mining station has been cut off.

00:06:26.450 --> 00:06:28.720
It appears there has been intervention from the military station.

00:06:28.820 --> 00:06:30.090
What!?

00:06:30.130 --> 00:06:33.990
That damn Miyagi! Does he intend to cut the lifeline to Second Earth?

00:06:34.060 --> 00:06:37.550
Please, look at this! The bulkheads of the education station!

00:06:43.400 --> 00:06:45.340
Even the education station...

00:06:45.410 --> 00:06:48.270
Their strategy is to fill the moat first, is it?

00:06:48.340 --> 00:06:52.680
They must be planning to isolate us.

00:06:52.750 --> 00:06:54.340
President Victor?

00:06:54.420 --> 00:06:56.470
There is no reason to panic.

00:06:56.550 --> 00:07:01.010
It has taken many long years for us to build this organization.

00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:05.030
I cannot believe that the soldiers of Second Earth would support Seno.

00:07:05.090 --> 00:07:06.360
Still...

00:07:06.430 --> 00:07:10.630
Look, Seno should soon revise his thinking.

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.670
So long as the Sleeper brigades

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:16.030
deliver military gains as we have planned...

00:07:16.100 --> 00:07:19.470
Yes, if they would so much as return...

00:07:30.790 --> 00:07:32.980
Goddamn it!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:35.650
Brenda! We can't hold out any longer! We're pulling back!

00:07:35.720 --> 00:07:37.320
Hurry and prepare to flee!

00:07:37.390 --> 00:07:42.330
Wait! I'm requesting support units now! Change route to join up with Yuji!

00:07:42.400 --> 00:07:44.330
Under present circumstances, we can't!

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:47.330
What about Tony!? Have Tony head toward them!

00:07:47.400 --> 00:07:50.670
Tony is in the Blue Nest. Alicia is with him.

00:07:50.740 --> 00:07:51.860
What!?

00:07:57.750 --> 00:08:03.380
Why is Alicia with Tony!? What are they doing inside the Nest!?

00:08:34.720 --> 00:08:38.520
You're the one who woke me up, aren't you, Marlene?

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:44.210
Do not... interfere...

00:08:49.400 --> 00:08:50.390
Yuji...?

00:08:59.740 --> 00:09:00.710
Yuji...

00:09:17.430 --> 00:09:19.690
Once your illness is all cured,

00:09:19.760 --> 00:09:24.030
why don't we go off somewhere together? Someplace far from here.

00:09:24.100 --> 00:09:25.090
Y- yeah.

00:09:59.400 --> 00:10:04.740
I've come all right, all the way to this place. Eh, Takashi...?

00:10:10.410 --> 00:10:15.680
I wonder how far I have to go.

00:10:15.750 --> 00:10:17.310
How far...?

00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:35.690
Please, start up...

00:10:57.060 --> 00:10:58.150
Yuji...

00:12:00.790 --> 00:12:01.910
Damn it all!!

00:12:09.460 --> 00:12:12.520
Heavy losses are developing along the defensive line, and it is receding.

00:12:12.600 --> 00:12:15.070
The Blue's second wave has come to within 500 meters.

00:12:15.140 --> 00:12:18.730
Estimate about three minutes until they reach this location.

00:12:18.810 --> 00:12:20.400
So this is where it ends?

00:12:20.480 --> 00:12:23.740
5th and 6th squads, move to support. Everyone else,

00:12:23.810 --> 00:12:25.400
hurry and prepare to launch the shuttle!

00:12:25.480 --> 00:12:27.740
It's too late! Su!

00:12:48.440 --> 00:12:54.030
Hmph, damned if I'm going to be done in by the likes of you!

00:12:54.110 --> 00:12:55.910
Not by the likes of you!!

00:13:30.140 --> 00:13:35.340
Just you wait! I'm coming now... Gonna squash you right away...!

00:14:07.110 --> 00:14:11.050
It's no use, you know...

00:14:11.120 --> 00:14:13.050
Even if you have changed machines,

00:14:13.120 --> 00:14:16.720
you cannot get the better of me any longer!

00:14:36.080 --> 00:14:39.340
You must not fight any more.

00:14:39.410 --> 00:14:43.280
And to that end, I'm gonna...!!

00:15:04.110 --> 00:15:05.800
Yuji!!

00:15:38.740 --> 00:15:43.680
Damn! ...Hey, you alive, Su?

00:15:43.740 --> 00:15:47.680
Even if it's just the two of us, we're heading for the shuttle.

00:15:47.750 --> 00:15:48.610
Yeah...

00:16:19.450 --> 00:16:25.220
Damn... Where are Yuji and Tony?

00:16:25.290 --> 00:16:29.550
If only they were here, we wouldn't be in this...

00:16:46.740 --> 00:16:51.470
It's all right. The analysis of your genomes has already been completed.

00:16:51.550 --> 00:16:56.680
All that's left is for us to find the data for the genetic therapy you need.

00:16:56.750 --> 00:17:03.660
However, we can't allow your conditions to proceed while we do that, so...

00:17:06.760 --> 00:17:13.690
There, as I was unable to do anything, only wait to be helped by someone, I...

00:17:13.770 --> 00:17:21.700
That's right... I have to go... After all... I...

00:17:28.780 --> 00:17:30.380
Yuji...?

00:17:30.450 --> 00:17:31.420
Damn...

00:17:38.060 --> 00:17:39.990
Yuji... Yuji!

00:17:40.060 --> 00:17:43.660
Don't interfere! I'm going!

00:17:46.400 --> 00:17:52.340
I don't want to get killed or anything with a face full of tears.

00:17:52.410 --> 00:17:55.670
I am going to defeat the Blue...

00:17:55.740 --> 00:18:02.340
Not Tony! Not even Victor! Me!

00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:05.680
They will die at my hand!

00:18:05.750 --> 00:18:07.690
...Yuji.

00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:15.660
Yung died! Joey died too! Takashi's gone! And so I...

00:18:17.100 --> 00:18:24.230
Takashi? That's right, he promised, and yet...

00:18:26.440 --> 00:18:28.370
Why!?

00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:37.010
There's no one! Nobody here... only me? What, are you serious!?

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:41.490
Stop... Don't go!!

00:18:47.060 --> 00:18:51.000
It's all right now, Yuji.

00:18:51.070 --> 00:18:56.000
It's all right now. You aren't a fighting machine.

00:18:56.070 --> 00:18:58.000
Stay away!

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.660
And so...

00:18:59.740 --> 00:19:01.900
Stay away!

00:19:06.080 --> 00:19:10.020
Go back... to the Yuji you used to be.

00:19:10.080 --> 00:19:18.360
Don't concern yourself with me! I'll kill you, the Blue and anything else!

00:19:18.430 --> 00:19:23.690
Go back... to the Yuji from the time that you journeyed with me.

00:19:23.760 --> 00:19:29.530
Me... and you...

00:20:01.400 --> 00:20:03.130
Marlene...

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.840
Yuji... thank goodness...

00:21:29.450 --> 00:21:38.940
Although the days when we smiled again and again
hohoemi kasaneta hibi ga

00:21:40.300 --> 00:21:45.070
Have passed away into dreams,
maboroshi ni natte mo

00:21:47.280 --> 00:21:54.220
I will surely not lose my way.
watashi wa kitto mayowanai

00:21:54.340 --> 00:22:00.390
To go on to the future,
mirai ni yuku tame ni

00:22:00.540 --> 00:22:06.810
To become an adult,
otona ni naru tame ni

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:14.000
I again recall now the memories
mogaite kita omoide wo kokoro de

00:22:14.190 --> 00:22:19.160
twisting in my heart.
ima wa kurikaesu

00:22:19.260 --> 00:22:25.220
I'm living in one time,
hitotsu no toki wo iki

00:22:25.520 --> 00:22:31.500
While choosing two dreams,
futatsu no yume erabi

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:38.980
And love taught me what it means...
soshite ai ga oshiete kureta yo ne

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:45.840
to cherish someone.
hito wo omou imi

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:57.410
I wanted to save everyone. Really, that's all. And yet, why did I...

00:22:57.480 --> 00:23:01.470
You've done well. It wasn't your fault, Yuji.

00:23:01.550 --> 00:23:03.420
Don't think about anything now.

00:23:03.490 --> 00:23:07.750
It's all right, very soon we can return to Second Earth.

00:23:07.820 --> 00:23:09.760
But, that isn't so!

00:23:09.830 --> 00:23:12.520
What's that!? Tony's done what!?
